    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d527">

                <pb facs="0470" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg396"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Pike</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 249.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State, Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 4, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your very interesting despatch of the 16th
                    ultimo, No. 173, informing me of the important matters which are engaging the
                    attention of the European <pb facs="0471" n="397" xml:id="pg397"/> public, has
                    been received, and I have, in reply, to inform you that I have invited the
                    attention of the Secretary of the Treasury to that portion which relates to the
                    financial situation in Europe.</p>
                <p>Upon representations which have been received from the diplomatic agents of the
                    United States in Europe, the attention of the governors and provisional
                    governors of the several States has been called to the reported progress of the
                    cholera westward, and the adoption of such measures as will prevent its
                    introduction into the United States has been recommenced.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James</hi> S. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Pike,</hi> Esq.,<hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c.,&amp;c.,&amp;</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
